{
  "id": "D_kwDOKrJqmc4AjA6n",
  "number": 713,
  "title": "help installing on microsoft powershell",
  "body": "i got to the point to where i have to enter command into powershell with password. when I enter the command in with what i know to be the proper password i get this message\r\n  0: Failed to get login info\r\n    1: error sending request\r\n    2: client error (Connect)\r\n    3: invalid URL, scheme is not http\r\nI'm extremely new to all of this any help would be appreciated.\nUpdate:\nStill no luck but now I'm getting retcode:201. Not sure what to do here  know I'm properly connect to the device because I can pull up the Verizon login page via local ip. \nUpdate: \nI figured it out, it was one possibly two things. You need to disconnect Ethernet connection either physically in your settings. My second issue for some reason the usb port I was plugged into didn't work for this process I switched to a usb port I knew I've flashed devices on with proper cable and it worked. To be clear same cable (carries data) different port.",
